The [[Apocrypha]] is an ancient [[Graven Monolith]] that was buried within [[Fahranur, the First City]] in the distant past and one of the few remnants from [[Abaddon]]'s time on [[Tyria (world)|Tyria]] before his fall. Due to this, it has been regarded as myth and unknown to many scholars, including [[Dunkoro]]. An old legend claims that it fell out of the sky as a gift from the stars. When [[Kormir]] was exploring the ruins of Fahranur, she awakened the Apocrypha and read from it, allowing Abaddon to influence her - though it is at first implied that [[General Kahyet]] awakened it when she obtained a scroll from the city. With its awakening, many [[Ancient Undead]] became active. It is killed within what is believed to be the [[Flooded Rianur]] of the city, and after its death, [[The Great Zehtuka]] claims credit of its death.

